  "description": "Nemesis Shield — Sentinel SDK for .NET / ASP.NET Core. Positive-security runtime protection: learns your app's normal behavior and blocks off-baseline requests (auth bypass, BOLA, path traversal, scanners, unusual methods) in enforce mode BEFORE your endpoints run, plus an OWASP-LLM prompt-injection guard with an embedded ML model (byte-identical across all Nemesis Shield SDKs). One line: app.UseMiddleware<NemesisShield.SentinelMiddleware>(). Fail-open, privacy-preserving. Targets net8.0 + netstandard2.0 (.NET Framework 4.6.1+ / .NET 6/8 / .NET Core).",
